Run migrations from the backend project root with:

    alembic upgrade head

Set DATABASE_URL to the existing PostgreSQL database before running this
command. Review the generated revision and take a database backup first.
This migration has not been applied to any database by this change.

New registrations receive the Support Agent role. To provision an initial
administrator or assign a different existing role, use a separately reviewed
database operation after registration; registration never accepts a role from
the client.
